  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="a9b4a4a5-a289-5d05-a1af-64c1aa65342d" activityNameId="b45e99c6-57cb-5672-8eea-b5927aa8f97d" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Printed wiring board, power supply unit desktop PC, Pb containing, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Printed wiring board, power supply unit desktop PC, Pb containing, at plant
The data represent the PWB of a power supply unit, used in modern Desktop PCs. Material data are based on own dismantling activities. Infrastructure and production efforts are based on own assumptions.;
UUID: 812a7b32-4a26-31f8-903d-3bb92267ab66
This dataset covers component input and production efforts (incl. PWB waste due to failure in mounting) for the production of a PWB used in the power supply unit of a desktop PC, using Pb-containing solder material.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: average PWB mounting technology (wave soldering)
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: own dismanlting 
Extrapolations: see Geography &amp; Technology
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_812a7b32-4a26-31f8-903d-3bb92267ab66.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="f4808887-5a57-5892-975e-ba0565a93e23" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
